00:48:18,072 --> 00:48:21,072
It doesn't sound like "min" at all!

942
00:48:21,072 --> 00:48:22,772
How is that Japanese?!

943
00:48:22,772 --> 00:48:25,572
ちょっと聞こえないんだよね。「M」。「M」の音なくない？
You really can't hear "M". Isn't there no "M" sound?

944
00:48:25,572 --> 00:48:28,072
There's no "M" sound!

945
