Let's play it for everyone.

959
00:49:01,072 --> 00:49:02,572
ほい。
Here.

960
00:49:03,572 --> 00:49:05,572
セミツー！
Cicada 2!

961
00:49:05,572 --> 00:49:07,572
あれ？
