What?

966
00:49:16,072 --> 00:49:19,072
はいはい、めっちゃ聞こえますね。多分日本人にはめちゃめちゃ...
Yes, yes, you hear it clearly. Probably to Japanese people, it's super...

967
00:49:19,072 --> 00:49:21,572
へー。
Oh...

968
00:49:21,572 --> 00:49:22,572
...聞こえる。
...obvious.

969
00:49:22,572 --> 00:49:24,072
What's the sound from?
Where's the sound from?

970
00:49:24,072 --> 00:49:25,072
え？
Huh?

971
00:49:25,072 --> 00:49:26,572
I don't know.

972
00:49:27,072 --> 00:49:28,572
What the heck?

973
00:49:38,072 --> 00:49:41,072
セミバージョン2ですよ。
It's Cicada Version 2!

974
00:49:47,572 --> 00:49:49,072
へー。
Hmm.

975
00:49:51,572 --> 00:49:53,072
分かるかな？
Can you tell?

976
00:49:53,072 --> 00:49:54,072
セミ2ね？
Cicada 2, right?

977
00:49:54,072 --> 00:49:55,572
セミツー。
Cicada 2.

978
00:49:55,572 --> 00:49:57,072
ヒントをお願いします。
Please give us a hint!

979
00:49:57,072 --> 00:49:58,572
ヒント？
A hint?

980
00:49:58,572 --> 00:50:00,072
ヒントはー...
The hint is...

981
00:50:01,280 --> 00:50:03,080
ヒントは...
The hint is...

982
