あの、「タタタタターン、タタタタターン」っていうのが鳴き声。
That "ta-ta-ta-ta-taan, ta-ta-ta-ta-taan" is its call.

983
00:50:08,080 --> 00:50:10,580
タタタタターン？／タタタタターン...
Ta-ta-ta-ta-taan? / Ta-ta-ta-ta-taan...

984
00:50:11,080 --> 00:50:13,580
が、日本人には...
But to Japanese people...

985
00:50:13,780 --> 00:50:18,080
「タタタタターン」、だからまあ5文字くらいかな？
"Ta-ta-ta-ta-taan", so about five letters or so?

986
00:50:18,080 --> 00:50:20,580
ん？ 5？／タタタタ...
Huh? Five? / Ta-ta-ta-ta...

987
00:50:20,580 --> 00:50:22,580
Pick a sound that makes that pattern.

988
00:50:22,780 --> 00:50:24,880
Pattern?
A pattern?

989
00:50:24,980 --> 00:50:27,280
ヒント難しいね、これは。
Giving hints for this is hard.

990
00:50:27,280 --> 00:50:29,080
ヒントとしてはムズいな。
As a hint, that's really tough.

991
00:50:29,580 --> 00:50:34,580
「タタタタターン」もオノマトペやろって言われたら、もうごめんなさい、それは。
If you say "ta-ta-ta-ta-taan" is an onomatopoeia too, then I'm sorry.

992
00:50:35,580 --> 00:50:37,380
えー、ムズ。
Man, that's hard.

993
00:50:38,280 --> 00:50:41,580
もうダダダダダダダダダしか思い出せない。
All I can think of is "da-da-da-da-da-da-da-da-da".

994
00:50:44,280 --> 00:50:46,080
Hmm, maybe...

995
00:50:46,180 --> 00:50:49,880
7文字だった！ ごめん、日本人には7文字。
It's seven letters! Sorry, to Japanese people it's seven.

996
00:50:50,180 --> 00:50:53,680
まあ伸ばし棒が入ります、あと。最後のほうに。
Also, there's a prolonged sound mark near the end.

997
00:50:54,080 --> 00:50:55,780
え？／There's an elongated...
Huh? / There's an elongated...

998
00:50:55,780 --> 00:50:58,380
え、7文字？／伸ばす？／There's an elongated sound.
Seven letters? / Prolonged? / There's an elongated sound.

999
00:50:58,380 --> 00:51:00,280
伸ばすと7文字ですね。
If you count the dash, it's seven characters.

1000
00:51:00,580 --> 00:51:02,580
えー...
Eh...

1001
