何やろ？ 「アゲハ」流しとくか。
What is it? Should I just write "Ageha"?

1002
00:51:07,780 --> 00:51:10,380
難しいね。／ムズい。
It's difficult. / Tough.

1003
00:51:10,380 --> 00:51:14,580
リズム自体はわかるんだけど、どう書いていいのかわからない。
I know the rhythm itself, but I don't know how to write it.

1004
00:51:14,580 --> 00:51:16,080
落ち着くね。
It's relaxing.

1005
00:51:16,080 --> 00:51:18,880
トトトトトトーン、ドドドドーンね。
Like "to-to-to-to-to-to-toan, do-do-do-doan", right?

1006
00:51:19,080 --> 00:51:20,180
落ち着く？
Relaxing?

1007
00:51:20,180 --> 00:51:23,780
この声を聞くと落ち着きますよ、「夏だな」って。
Hearing this sound relaxes you, thinking "Ah, it's summer."

1008
00:51:23,780 --> 00:51:25,580
ええ？
Huh?

1009
00:51:25,580 --> 00:51:29,080
Apparently the sound is relaxing to the Japanese.

1010
00:51:29,080 --> 00:51:31,080
ええ？
What?

1011
00:51:31,080 --> 00:51:33,280
落ち着くよね。
It's relaxing, right?

1012
00:51:35,080 --> 00:51:36,580
Okay.

1013
00:51:36,580 --> 00:51:39,080
じゃあ行きましょうか。よぴぴから。
Alright, let's go. Starting with Yopipi.

1014
00:51:39,080 --> 00:51:43,080
いや、「ククククククク」じゃないですか？ セミバージョン2。
Isn't it "ku-ku-ku-ku-ku-ku-ku"? Cicada version 2.

1015
00:51:43,080 --> 00:51:45,380
セミバージョン2？ セミバージョン2って何？
Cicada version 2? What's cicada version 2?

1016
00:51:45,380 --> 00:51:47,380
クククククッね。／クククククッで。
"Ku-ku-ku-ku-ku", right. / "Ku-ku-ku-ku-ku".

1017
00:51:47,380 --> 00:51:49,080
おー。／オーイ。
Ooh. / All right.

1018
00:51:49,080 --> 00:51:51,580
オッケーオッケー。じゃあこぼちゃん。
Okay, okay. Next, Kobo-chan.

1019
00:51:54,080 --> 00:51:58,080
Um... so...

1020
00:51:58,580 --> 00:52:03,080
The previous one was "ming-ming", right?

1021
00:52:03,580 --> 00:52:08,580
And uh I heard this is more than "ming-ming",

1022
00:52:08,580 --> 00:52:13,580
so it's a mating call like "meng-meng-meng-meng"!

1023
00:52:13,580 --> 00:52:15,580
ちょっと待って。
Wait a minute.

1024
00:52:15,580 --> 00:52:18,080
そもそも、why did you write "Mating Call"?
In the first place, why did you write "Mating Call"?

1025
00:52:18,080 --> 00:52:21,080
ええと、求愛の鳴き声、「メンメン」です。
Um, a mating call: "meng-meng".

1026
00:52:21,080 --> 00:52:24,080
ああー。でも求愛の鳴き声なんだよね、実際。
Ah. But it actually is a mating call.

1027
00:52:24,080 --> 00:52:26,580
あ、そうなの！？／So yes!
Oh, really?! / So yes!

1028
00:52:26,580 --> 00:52:29,080
Wait, it is a mating call?!

1029
00:52:29,080 --> 00:52:32,580
It is! Oh my god, I won! I'm right!

1030
00:52:32,780 --> 00:52:38,580
セミのオスがあの、「メス来てー」って言ってるときの声だから、そこは正しい。
It's the sound of male cicadas calling out for females, so that part is right.

1031
00:52:38,580 --> 00:52:40,580
へえー！
Wow!

1032
00:52:40,580 --> 00:52:42,080
求愛ですね。
It's a courtship call.

1033
00:52:42,080 --> 00:52:44,880
Oh my god.／「Oh my god」コールだ！
Oh my god. / It's the "Oh my god" call!

1034
00:52:44,880 --> 00:52:48,080
でも「メンメン」が正しいかどうかね。
But whether "meng-meng" is correct or not...

1035
00:52:48,080 --> 00:52:51,580
Ah so "meng-meng", ne? Okay.／Whether it's "meng-meng" or not.
Ah, so "meng-meng", right? Okay. / Whether it's "meng-meng" or not.

1036
00:52:51,580 --> 00:52:54,080
オーイ。続いてジジ。
All right. Next is Gigi.

1037
00:52:54,580 --> 00:52:58,580
Um... td-d-d-d-JEET... td-d-d-d-JEET... td-d-d-d-JEET...

1038
00:52:58,580 --> 00:53:01,080
...JEET!

1039
